Usage: semaphore-cli config validate <file> [flags]

Check a bootstrap file with the loader of the relay proxy

Reads <file> with the strict loader of the relay proxy: version 2 required,
unknown keys, bad references and bad values are errors that name the file,
the path of the key and the line. Secret references are checked for their shape,
not resolved. Exit code 0 when valid, 2 when invalid, 1 on another failure.

Arguments:
  <file>    Bootstrap file to check.

Flags:
  -h, --help             Show context-sensitive help.
  -v, --version          Print the version and exit

  -o, --output="text"    output format: text or json (YAML for print)
